CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F366A1785779366
OL,3,CMore than 200 public figures sign open
OL,4,Cletter to save Jodrell Bank observatory
OL,6,FMore than 200 celebrities have signed
OL,7,Fan open letter to save a space
OL,8,Fobservatory in Cheshire.
OL,10,FThe Jodrell Bank Observatory, which
OL,11,Fhas housed the UK's largest telescope
OL,12,Ffor nearly 70 years, has lost its
OL,13,Ffunding leaving it facing an uncertain
OL,14,Ffuture.
OL,16,FStars of stage, screen, music and
OL,17,Fwriting, as well as leading scientists
OL,18,Fhave written to the government asking
OL,19,Fthem to reconsider.
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G1/12
OL,2,W/*%+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
