OL,24,ANext Page BNW Eng NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,367,360,120,260,000,100
PN,36602
SC,0002
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F366A1785779366
OL,3,CMore than 200 public figures sign open
OL,4,Cletter to save Jodrell Bank observatory
OL,6,FMusicians including Brian May, New
OL,7,FOrder, Peter Hook, Johnny Marr and
OL,8,FElbow have signed the letter to
OL,9,Fsupport the observatory, which is used
OL,10,Ffor world-leading research and is a
OL,11,Fpopular tourist attraction for
OL,12,Fstargazers.
OL,14,FThey are joined by the poet laureate
OL,15,FSimon Armitage, as well as scientist
OL,16,FProfessor Brian Cox.
OL,18,FThe deep-space observatory in Cheshire
OL,19,Fruns a world-leading network of radio
OL,20,Ftelescopes and hosts the Grade I-
OL,21,Flisted Lovell telescope.
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G2/12
OL,2,W/*%+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNW Eng NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,367,360,120,260,000,100
PN,36603
SC,0003
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F366A1785779366
OL,3,CMore than 200 public figures sign open
OL,4,Cletter to save Jodrell Bank observatory
OL,6,FThe funding body, the UK Research and
OL,7,FInnovation (UKRI) agency, said it had
OL,8,Fto focus investment on the "greatest
OL,9,Flong-term scientific capability and
OL,10,Fvalue."
OL,12,FThe UKRI are withdrawing funding for
OL,13,F'e-Merlin' - the UK's national radio
OL,14,Fastronomy facility - which links seven
OL,15,Fradio telescopes, including Jodrell
OL,16,FBank across Great Britain when the
OL,17,Fcurrent arrangement ends in March 2028.
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G3/12
OL,2,W/*%+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNW Eng NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,367,360,120,260,000,100
PN,36604
SC,0004
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F366A1785779366
OL,3,CMore than 200 public figures sign open
OL,4,Cletter to save Jodrell Bank observatory
OL,6,FMusic producer and writer Paul Morley
OL,7,Fsaid: "Jodrell Bank was a huge,
OL,8,Finspiring presence in my childhood,
OL,9,Fwidening my horizons beyond Stockport,
OL,10,FEngland, Europe, The World."
OL,12,FHe said it is "still the place when I
OL,13,Fsee it on the horizon from the train
OL,14,Fafter Stoke coming to Stockport or
OL,15,FManchester when I know I am in the
OL,16,FNorth."
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G4/12
OL,2,W/*%+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNW Eng NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,367,360,120,260,000,100
PN,36605
SC,0005
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F366A1785779366
OL,3,CMore than 200 public figures sign open
OL,4,Cletter to save Jodrell Bank observatory
OL,6,FFellow campaigner, singer and writer
OL,7,FJohn Robb added: "Jodrell Bank is not
OL,8,Fonly iconic, it saw the future and it
OL,9,Fchanged perceptions. It is one of the
OL,10,Fjewels of the crown of the North and
OL,11,Finspiration to generations."
OL,13,FThe site was first established in
OL,14,F1945, and its contribution to global
OL,15,Fscientific efforts earned it UNESCO
OL,16,FWorld Heritage status in 2019.
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G5/12
OL,2,W/*%+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNW Eng NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,367,360,120,260,000,100
PN,36606
SC,0006
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F366A1785779366
OL,3,CMore than 200 public figures sign open
OL,4,Cletter to save Jodrell Bank observatory
OL,6,FOne of the organisers of the campaign,
OL,7,FRa Page, said, "This is obviously a
OL,8,Fchastening time for researchers in all
OL,9,Fareas of academia, and cuts are being
OL,10,Ffaced across the board, in all
OL,11,Fdisciplines.
OL,13,F"Physics is just one these. But we
OL,14,Fhave to change this narrative. The
OL,15,Fpoint of investment is it is an
OL,16,Finvestment, it will pay off in untold
OL,17,Fand unforeseen ways later down the
OL,18,Fline, in ways that will benefit all of
OL,19,Fus.
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G6/12
OL,2,W/*%+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNW Eng NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,367,360,120,260,000,100
PN,36607
SC,0007
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F366A1785779366
OL,3,CMore than 200 public figures sign open
OL,4,Cletter to save Jodrell Bank observatory
OL,6,FAdding, he said: "You cannot always
OL,7,Fpredict what you will find. That's why
OL,8,Fit is so inspiring. But If we all
OL,9,Fbecome beancounters in our outlook,
OL,10,Fwhat will inspire our next generation,
OL,11,Fwhat chance will British research
OL,12,Fhave, in the future marketplace of
OL,13,Finnovation?
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G7/12
OL,2,W/*%+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNW Eng NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,367,360,120,260,000,100
PN,36608
SC,0008
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F366A1785779366
OL,3,CMore than 200 public figures sign open
OL,4,Cletter to save Jodrell Bank observatory
OL,6,FA spokesperson from UKRI said: "The
OL,7,FScience and Technology Facilities
OL,8,FCouncil (STFC) has undertaken a
OL,9,Frigorous prioritisation process to
OL,10,Ffocus investment on the areas that
OL,11,Fwill deliver the greatest long-term
OL,12,Fscientific capability, impact and
OL,13,Fvalue for the UK.
OL,15,F"The decision to withdraw funding from
OL,16,Fe-MERLIN at the end of its current
OL,17,Ffunding agreement is the result of a
OL,18,Fcomprehensive, evidence-based
OL,19,Fprioritisation process.
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G8/12
OL,2,W/*%+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNW Eng NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,367,360,120,260,000,100
PN,36609
SC,0009
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F366A1785779366
OL,3,CMore than 200 public figures sign open
OL,4,Cletter to save Jodrell Bank observatory
OL,6,F"As part of this, STFC is focusing
OL,7,Finvestment on the areas that will
OL,8,Fdeliver the greatest long-term
OL,9,Fscientific capability and value,
OL,10,Fincluding the next generation of world-
OL,11,Fleading radio astronomy facilities.
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G9/12
OL,2,W/*%+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNW Eng NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,367,360,120,260,000,100
PN,36610
SC,0010
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F366A1785779366
OL,3,CMore than 200 public figures sign open
OL,4,Cletter to save Jodrell Bank observatory
OL,6,F"STFC continues to invest in Jodrell
OL,7,FBank's future through its support for
OL,8,Fthe UK's hosting of the SKAO
OL,9,Fheadquarters, which is already
OL,10,Fdelivering significant benefits to the
OL,11,FUniversity of Manchester and the North
OL,12,FWest. The current e-MERLIN funding
OL,13,Fagreement runs until March 2028,
OL,14,Fproviding time to explore alternative
OL,15,Ffunding arrangements."
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}     G10/12
OL,2,W/*%+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNW Eng NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,367,360,120,260,000,100
PN,36611
SC,0011
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F366A1785779366
OL,3,CMore than 200 public figures sign open
OL,4,Cletter to save Jodrell Bank observatory
OL,6,FSecretary of State for Business,
OL,7,FInnovation, Science and Trade Jonathan
OL,8,FReynolds said: "Our world-class
OL,9,Fscience and research sector is
OL,10,Fabsolutely central to creating a
OL,11,Fbetter future for the UK, by advancing
OL,12,Fknowledge, improving lives and driving
OL,13,Fgrowth across every region.
OL,15,F'That is why we are funding R&D at
OL,16,Frecord levels, including #38.6 billion
OL,17,Finvested in UKRI over the coming years
OL,18,Fto drive research that delivers real
OL,19,Fimpact for the public.
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}     G11/12
OL,2,W/*%+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNW Eng NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,367,360,120,260,000,100
PN,36612
SC,0012
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F366A1785779366
OL,3,CMore than 200 public figures sign open
OL,4,Cletter to save Jodrell Bank observatory
OL,6,F"UKRI is responsible for taking
OL,7,Fspecific funding decisions, but I am
OL,8,Fcommitted to working with UKRI to
OL,9,Fensure the UK remains able not only to
OL,10,Fsustain its world-leading research
OL,11,Fcapabilities, but also to invest in
OL,12,Fthe next generation of scientific
OL,13,Ffacilities and infrastructure that
OL,14,Fwill underpin discovery, innovation
OL,15,Fand growth in the years ahead."
OL,17,FWant more on the issues affecting the
OL,18,FNorth? Our podcast, From the North
OL,19,Fanswers the questions that matter to
OL,20,Four region.
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}     G12/12
